; Nine cards a segment in (pc, kind, ts, te, nxtpc, the VOICED, NOISE and ALT cards of row pc of the phoneme
; table, and the BACK card of row nxtpc), five out: the filters of the segment's sounding frames, ma
; and mb (they glide from ma to mb by u when uon is 1, a vowel), vm (voiced) and gl (glides at the ends). A vowel,
; sonorant, nasal or HH speaks through its own targets, ts to te, with glides; HH unvoiced. A fricative or
; affricate through its noise filter (NOISE), voiced as the table says (VOICED); a stop's burst through NOISE,
; unvoiced, or through its back form (ALT) when it has one and the next sound is a back vowel (BACK).
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   pc       03-22: a segment; a pause: nothing
  04                    INP   kind
  05                    INP   ts
  06                    INP   te
  07                    INP   nxtpc
  08                    INP   voiced
  09                    INP   noise
  10                    INP   alt
  11                    INP   back
  12                    CLA   z
  13                    STO   ma
  14                    STO   mb
  15                    STO   uon
  16                    STO   gl
  17                    CLA   00
  18                    STO   vm
  19                    CLA   kind
  20                    SUB   c8
  21                    TAC   snd
  22                    JMP   out
  23            snd     CLA   kind     23-44: own targets: a vowel, a sonorant, a nasal, HH
  24                    SUB   n4
  25                    TAC   own
  26                    SUB   n3
  27                    TAC   ask
  28            own     CLA   ts
  29                    STO   ma
  30                    CLA   te
  31                    STO   mb
  32                    CLA   00
  33                    STO   gl
  34                    CLA   kind
  35                    SUB   n2
  36                    TAC   vow
  37                    SUB   n5
  38                    TAC   out
  39                    CLA   z
  40                    STO   vm
  41                    JMP   out
  42            vow     CLA   00
  43                    STO   uon
  44                    JMP   out
  45            ask     CLA   noise   45-64: an obstruent's noise, a stop's back form
  46                    STO   ma
  47                    STO   mb
  48                    CLA   voiced
  49                    STO   vm
  50                    CLA   kind
  51                    SUB   n5
  52                    TAC   stop
  53                    JMP   out
  54            stop    CLA   z
  55                    STO   vm
  56                    CLA   alt
  57                    SUB   00
  58                    TAC   out
  59            askb    CLA   back
  60                    SUB   00
  61                    TAC   out
  62                    CLA   alt
  63                    STO   ma
  64                    STO   mb
  65            out     OUT   ma       65-90: the five cards
  66                    OUT   mb
  67                    OUT   uon
  68                    OUT   vm
  69                    OUT   gl
  70                    JMP   rec
  71            pc      DATA  0
  72            kind    DATA  0
  73            ts      DATA  0
  74            te      DATA  0
  75            nxtpc   DATA  0
  76            ma      DATA  0
  77            mb      DATA  0
  78            uon     DATA  0
  79            vm      DATA  0
  80            gl      DATA  0
  81            voiced  DATA  0
  82            noise   DATA  0
  83            alt     DATA  0
  84            back    DATA  0
  85            z       DATA  0
  86            c8      DATA  8
  87            n4      DATA  4
  88            n3      DATA  3
  89            n2      DATA  2
  90            n5      DATA  5
